  "body": "## What changed\n\nRegenerate `examples/first-part.nc` from its shipped project.\nAdd `examples/first-router-part.nc` from its shipped project.\nAdd complete-output pins that run the CLI process pipeline for both projects.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe mill NC still came from the original example commit, 993a241b0.\nNo test compared it with current generated output.\nThe router example had no shipped NC.\n\n## Tests\n\n`first_part_posts_the_shipped_program` failed on the original mill NC.\n`first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program` failed because the router NC was missing.\nBoth pass with the regenerated fixtures.\nRestoring the upstream mill NC makes its pin fail again; restoring the regenerated NC passes.\nRemoving the router NC makes its pin fail again; restoring it passes.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passes.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nTwo NC files changed; no CL files changed.\n`examples/first-part.nc` now has 369 lines.\nIts reviewed changes are G21, decimal formatting, initial clearance moves, pocket helical re-entries, and separate drill cycles with clearance retracts.\n`examples/first-router-part.nc` adds the full 151-line grblHAL program for drilling, pocketing and the tabbed contour.\nBoth files come directly from successful CLI generation and verification.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo physical machine run or Windows run was performed.\nNo GUI or release gate was run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone found for the four changed files.\nThe branch starts at upstream/main b629dc7e8.\n\nChangelog: Refresh the first-part NC example and ship the router NC example, with CLI regression pins for both.\n\nFixes #2422\n",
